      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona Joshuwa wakusanya mbari zosi za Iziraeli hiko Shekemu. Achiaiha atumia, vilongozi, aamuli na maofisaa a Iziraeli, achendaima mbere za Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 11:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Joshuwa achigomba na Aiziraeli osi achiaambira, “Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba, ‘Hipho kare, akare enu — Tera na anae a chilume yani Burahimu na Nahori — asagala tsi iriyo ngʼambo ya muho Yufurati nao achihumikira milungu yanjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.1+GEN.12.2+GEN.12.3+GEN.12.4+GEN.12.5+GEN.12.6+GEN.12.7+GEN.12.8+GEN.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 12:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1+GEN.21.2+GEN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 21:1–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi námhala sowe yenu Burahimu kula ngʼambo ya nyo muho nami nchimlongoza kpwenye tsi yosi ya Kanani na nchimuhenda akale na chivyazi chinji. Námupha Isaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.24+GEN.25.25+GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 25:24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 36:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 46:1–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kutsupira Isaka nchimupha Jakobo na Esau. Esau námupha tsi ya myango ya Seiri ili ikale yakpwe, ela Jakobo na anae achiphiya Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kutsama 3:1—12:42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchihuma Musa na Aruni, nchiapiga atu a tsi ya Misiri kpwa gosi higo nrigogahenda himo, badaye nchikutuluzani kula tsi iyo ya Misiri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 14:1–31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nriphotuluza akare enu kula Misiri, mwafika Bahari ya Shamu na jeshi ra Amisiri richikulungani na magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi na aphirikie hadi pho baharini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Aiziraeli ariphoniririra mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu naika jiza kahi-kahi yao na Amisiri na kuihenda bahari iangamize Amisiri. Namwi mwadzionera gara nrigohenda Amisiri. Chisha mchisala jangbwani muda mure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 21:21–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nákurehani hadi tsi ya Aamori ariosagala uphande wa phiri wa muho Joridani. Aho apigana namwi viha, nami nchikuhendani muaturye. Náangamiza mbere zenu na tsi yao mchiihala ichikala yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Isabu 22:1—24:25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mfalume wa Moabu, Balaki mwana wa Sipori wakpwedzashambuliya Aiziraeli. Iye wahuma ujumbe kpwa Balaamu mwana wa Beori ili akulanini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela siyamphundza Balaamu, kpwa hivyo iye achikujaliyani nami nchikutivyani kula mikononi mwa Balaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.3.14+JOS.3.15+JOS.3.16+JOS.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 3:14–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.1+JOS.6.2+JOS.6.3+JOS.6.4+JOS.6.5+JOS.6.6+JOS.6.7+JOS.6.8+JOS.6.9+JOS.6.10+JOS.6.11+JOS.6.12+JOS.6.13+JOS.6.14+JOS.6.15+JOS.6.16+JOS.6.17+JOS.6.18+JOS.6.19+JOS.6.20+JOS.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 6:1–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mriphovuka muho Joridani na kufika Jeriko, enyezi a Jeriko apigana namwi, vivyo hivyo Aamori, Aperizi, Akanani, Ahiti, Agirigashi, Ahivi na Ajebusi. Aho náahenda muaturye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 23:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 7:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naahenda ainjirwe ni chiwewe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Neno ra Chieburania ni mivi (adudu), uhu unaweza kukala msemo wa Chieburania ambao manage ni kuatiya chiwewe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na kukakama mbere zenu, nchiahenda nyo afalume airi a Aamori achimbire. Aho taayachimbira kpwa sababu ya panga zenu wala maha genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.10+DEU.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 6:10–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuphani tsi ambayo tamuihenderere kazi, midzi ambayo tamuyaidzenga ambamo vivi munasagala na kurya matunda ga mizabibu na mizaituni ambayo tamyaiphanda.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo, vivi sambi muogopheni Mwenyezi Mlungu na mumuhumikire moyo kutsuka na uaminifu. Richani milungu ambayo akare enu aihumikira ariphokala ngʼambo ya muho Yufurati na ariphokala Misiri, muhumikireni Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi ichikala tamlonda kumuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu, tsambulani ihi rero ndiyemuhumikira, ichikala ni milungu ambayo akare enu ahumikira ngʼambo ya muho Yufurati ama milungu ya Aamori ambao tsi yao munaisagala, ela mimi na nyumba yangu hundahumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho atu amjibu achiamba, “Tahundamricha Mwenyezi Mlungu bii na kuhumikira milungu yanjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu ndiye ariyehutuluza swiswi phamwenga na akare ehu kula tsi ya Misiri, hurikokala atumwa, naswi huchiona ishara za ajabu arizohenda. Achihurinda na vyaro vyehu vyosi na kahi za atu osi ambao hwatsupa kahi-kahi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiye yezoresa mbere zehu atu osi yani Aamori osi ariosagala tsi ihi. Kpwa hivyo, naswi hundamuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu, mana iye ndiye Mlungu wehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Joshuwa achiaambira, “Mwimwi tamuweza kumuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu, mana iye ni Mlungu mtakatifu. Iye ni Mlungu mwenye wivu naye kandakuswameheni makosa wala dambi zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchimricha Mwenyezi Mlungu na kuhumikira milungu ya chijeni, andakutiyani adabu na kukuangamizani tse, hata dzagbwe wakuhenderani manono higo gosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao atu achimuamba Joshuwa, “Hata! Swiswi hundamuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu bahi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho Joshuwa achiambira, “Mwimwi enye mmashaidi a mioyo yenu kukala mkatsambula kumuhumikira Mwenyezi Mlungu.” Nao achijibu achiamba, “Swiswi enye hu mashaidi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Joshuwa achiamba, “Phahi usani milungu ya chijeni mriyonayo mumlunge Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli kpwa mioyo yenu yosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimjibu achiamba, “Hundamuhumikira na kumtii Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Joshuwa achiika chilagane na Aiziraeli hiko Shekemu, achiapha masharuti na malagizo ga kulunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshuwa wagaandika higa gosi katika chitabu cha shariya cha Mlungu, chisha achihala dziwe kulu achiriimisa tsini ya muhi uihwao mwaloni phephi na hema ra Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Joshuwa achiaambira Aiziraeli osi, “Dziwe hiri ndiro ndirokala shaidi kpwehu mana rikasikira maneno gosi ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu akahuambira. Kpwa hivyo rindashuhudiya kuahusu, ili sedze mkarema Mlungu wenu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Joshuwa waabumula hara atu, chila mmwenga achiuya kpwakpwe kpwenye seemuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
