                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mifupha ya Yusufu ambayo Aiziraeli kala akaireha kula Misiri aizika hiko Shekemu. Seemu iyo ariyozikpwa kala ni eneo ambaro Jakobo kala akarigula kula kpwa ana a Hamori, Ise wa Shekemu, kpwa vipande gana mwenga vya feza. Arizi hino kala ikakala urisi wa chivyazi cha Yusufu.",
          "type": "text",
